\par\par \b \uc2 DJ   \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2  CHAT: USD/IDR Up; IDR Depreciation Healthy Correction-Citi\b0\par\par\uc2 204 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 11 Juni 2013\par 04:08\par \uc2 Dow Jones Chinese Newswires English Content\par \uc2 RTNW\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 2013, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 The USD/IDR is slightly higher at 9,820 in the interbank market vs 9,815 on the greenback's general strength, with suspected \uc2 Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  slowing the pair's rise. Two dealers suspect the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to have sold around $30 million at 9,820 as foreign investors continued to sell local stocks and bonds Monday, exacerbated also by concerns over the country's current account deficit and the government's budget deficit. Although the USD/IDR is gearing toward 10,000, \uc2 Citigroup\uc2  says in a report that the IDR's depreciation is still a healthy adjustment. Although the IDR has weakened by about 3.5% vs the USD year-to-date, on a trade-weighted and inflation-adjusted basis, the IDR had in fact strengthened by about 2%, it says; "arguably a weakening of the IDR on real effective exchange rate basis is more desirable to correct the external imbalance." Dealers tip a 9,810-9,840 band for the pair in the session.(i-made.sentana@dowjones.com)\par \par \uc2 Contact us in Singapore. 65 64154 140; MarketTalk@dowjones.com\par \par \uc2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\par \par \uc2 11-06-13 0208GMT\par \par \uc2 Dokument RTNW000020130611e96b0002u\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
