\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia \highlight\uc2  Finance Minister:  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank \highlight\uc2  Should Sell More Dollars When  \highlight22\uc2 Intervening \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 By Farida Husna   \par \uc2 230 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 25 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2013\par 12:52\par \uc2 Dow Jones Global Equities News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2013 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 JAKARTA--\b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's finance minister on Monday said the country's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  should \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market by selling dollars in large amounts, in contrast to its current practice of supporting the ailing rupiah with relatively small manipulations.\par \par \uc2 Agus Martowardojo, undergoing a vetting process in his bid to become the new chief of the nation's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , told lawmakers at the House of Representatives that selling dollars "would be better if not done little by little, as this only makes the market fearful" by suggesting \uc2 Bank Indonesia\uc2  is reluctant to defend the rupiah or doesn't have enough dollars.\par \par \uc2 "Consequently, the rupiah will fall even more and as a result we have to sell more dollars," he added.\par \par \uc2 The Indonesian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been one of Asia's worst performers since last year, dropping more than 8 percent in the past 12 months. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  says it \b \highlight22\uc2 intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market to reduce volatility in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Mr. Martowardojo, picked by President \uc2 Susilo Bambang Yudhoyono\uc2  to head the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  for a five-year term beginning in May, faces a second day of vetting Tuesday, when a House panel will vote on recommending his candidacy before the entire House.\par \par \uc2 Write to Farida Husna at farida.husna@dowjones.com [ 25-03-13 1206GMT ]\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020130325e93p000kt\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
