        agrees that it will observe all \par                                               applicable provisions of law in \par                                               each jurisdiction in or from which \par                                               it may offer or sell Notes or distribute \par                                               any offering material. \par  \par  \par  \par  Other Relevant Terms \par  1.     Listing:                           Application has been made for the \par                                             Notes to be admitted to the Official \par                                             List of the \f28 \uc2 \f2 United Kingdom Listing \par                                             Authority\f28 \uc2 \f2  and to trading on the \par                                             \f28 \uc2 \f2 London Stock Exchange plc\f28 \uc2 \f2 's Regulated \par                                             Market. \par  2.     Details of Clearance System \par          Approved by the Bank and \par          the \par          Global Agent and Clearance         Euroclear and Clearstream, Luxembourg \par          and \par          Settlement Procedures: \par  3.     Syndicated:                        No \par  4.     Commissions and Concessions:       1.375% of the Aggregate Principal \par                                             Amount (comprised of a 1.1875% selling \par                                             concession and a 0.1875% management \par                                             and underwriting fee). \par  5.     Estimated Total Expenses:          None. The Dealer has agreed to pay \par                                             for all material expenses related \par                                             to the issuance of the Notes. \par  6.     Codes: \par   (a) Common Code:                         088181174 \par   (b) ISIN:                                XS0881811748 \par  7.     Identity of Manager:               \f28 \uc2 \f2 The Toronto-Dominion Bank\f28 \uc2 \f2  \par  8.     Identity of Calculation            \f28 \uc2 \f2 The Toronto-Dominion Bank\f28 \uc2 \f2 , Toronto \par          Agent: \par                                             In relation to the Fixing Date, \par                                             as soon as is reasonably practicable \par                                             after the determination of the Applicable \par                                             Rate in relation thereto, on the \par                                             date on which the relevant Applicable \par                                             Rate is to be determined (or, if \par                                             such date is not a Relevant Business \par                                             Day, then on the next succeeding \par                                             Relevant Business Day), the Calculation \par                                             Agent shall notify the Issuer and \par                                             the Global Agent of the Applicable \par                                             Rate, and the Interest Amount, and \par                                             the Redemption Amount or Early Redemption \par                                             Amount, as the case may be, in relation \par                                             thereto. \par                                             All determinations of the Calculation \par                                             Agent shall (in the absence of manifest \par                                             error) be final and binding on all \par                                             parties (including, but not limited \par                                             to, the Bank and the Noteholders) \par                                             and shall be made in its sole discretion \par                                  