\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1-Indonesia govt sees weaker rupiah, cbank defends 9,700 to the dlr\b0\par\par\uc2 By Adriana Nina Kusuma and Neil Chatterjee   \par \uc2 575 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 14 Januar 2013\par 05:37\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2013 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 (Updates with details, dealer comment)\par \par \uc2 JAKARTA, Jan 14 (Reuters) - Indonesia has downgraded its forecast for the rupiah this year, with a floor of 9,700 per dollar, a level the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has defended in recent days as nervous investors put the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  under pressure.\par \par \uc2 The government had budgeted for a rupiah at 9,300 per dollar in 2013, but expectations that weak commodity exports would continue to fuel trade and current account deficits means real market prices are already being quoted by dealers at around 9,900.\par \par \uc2 The depreciating \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  has weakened sentiment towards the country's stocks and bonds and dented the fast growing G20 economy's appeal as a safe haven for investors.\par \par \uc2 There has been no big sell-off in rupiah assets so far, with foreign bond ownership rising to record levels at 33 percent of the total and stocks rising 1.4 percent on Monday to near a record record hit earlier this month.\par \par \uc2 However, a spike in one-month forward prices show foreigners are hedging positions.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's indicative spot price has traded at or below 9,700 per dollar in the past five trading sessions, yet has closed above that level each time at around 9,650, with traders pointing to the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  by selling dollars.\par \par \uc2 "\uc2 Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  will always be ready to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  if the rupiah depreciates excessively from its fundamentals," \uc2 Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's Governor Darmin Nasution told parliament on Monday.\par \par \uc2 The rupiah was emerging Asia's worst performing \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  last year, shedding nearly 6 percent, and has slipped another 0.3 percent so far in 2013.\par \par \uc2 It was not clear what the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sees as the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's fundamental level.\par \par \uc2 This time last year it made the same noises and appeared to be defending 9,200, but it then let the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  weaken and now that level appears to be 9,700.\par \par \uc2 "That is where the market thinks they are at the moment," said a Jakarta-based \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealer. "They are trying to manage the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  rate within the government forecast to parliament. They also want to smoothen the curve for gradual depreciation."\par \par \uc2 Finance Minister Agus Martowardojo told parliament on Monday the rupiah will continue to weaken due to pressures from an uncertain global economic situation and the wider current account deficit, estimated at around $10 billion last quarter.\par \par \uc2 The finance ministry said in November it was comfortable with the rupiah at around 9,600, as that level may ease the country's trade imbalances by helping exporters and cutting down on surging imports.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has kept interest rates at a record low to maintain economic growth at above 6 percent.\par \par \uc2 Analysts are now calling for rate hikes to support the rupiah, but pro-growth policymakers are likely to keep that as a last resort.\par \par \uc2 Instead, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is likely to use its foreign reserves, built up to $112.8 billion by December from $106.5 billion six months earlier, as firepower to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  if the 9,700 level is broken.\par \par \uc2 "They will come at 9,800 and defend it. Then 9,900. They are ready," said the Jakarta dealer.\par \par \uc2 (Additional reporting by Jongwoo Cheong in Singapore; Editing by Kim Coghill)\par \par \uc2 INDONESIA-ECONOMY/RUPIAH (UPDATE 1) | ABN | D | E | RBN | IF | M | ABX | RNP | DNP   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020130114e91e0005e\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
