\par\par \b \uc2 *DJ Indonesia  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2  Reserves Down $1.73B To $110.49B At End March\b0\par\par\uc2 252 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 5 April 2012\par 15:15\par \uc2 Dow Jones Institutional News\par \uc2 DJDN\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 2012, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  -- \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 5 Apr 2012 09:25 EDT DJ \par Indonesia \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 FX\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  Reserves Down $1.73B To $110.49B At End-March\f28 \par \par \uc2 By Andreas Ismar\par \par \uc2 Of DOW JONES NEWSWIRES\par \par \uc2 JAKARTA, Indonesia (Dow Jones)--Indonesia's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves fell $1.73 billion in March from the preceding month, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said Thursday.\par \par \uc2 Bank Indonesia said the reserves stood at $110.49 billion at the end of March compared with February's $112.22 billion.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  did not provide a reason for the drop, although analysts attributed the decline to Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in supporting the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The rupiah lost about 1% against the dollar in March, Bank Indonesia data showed, partly due to inflation concerns over a fuel price-increase plan.\par \par \uc2 The parliament last week rejected the plan, but uncertainties over subsidized-fuel policy continue to cloud Southeast Asia's biggest economy.\par \par \uc2 The country's foreign reserves have been in a declining trend from an all-time high of $124.64 billion at the end of August as Bank Indonesia supported the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  and bonds.\par \par \uc2 The reserves as of March, however, were more than twice the $51.64 billion at the end of 2008, during which Indonesia's financial markets faced headwinds due to the collapse of \uc2 Lehman Brothers\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 -By Andreas Ismar, Dow Jones Newswires; 62 21 39831277; andreasismar.sandiwan@dowjones.com\par \par \uc2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\par \par \uc2 April 05, 2012 09:25 ET (13:25 GMT)\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJDN000020120405e845003h9\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
