\par\par \b \uc2 INTERVIEW: \uc2 IMF\uc2 's Zavadjil: Indonesia Planned Fuel Price Hike 'Very Positive' Development\b0\par\par\uc2 517 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 1 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2012\par 12:59\par \uc2 Dow Jones News Service\par \uc2 DJ\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2012 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 -- IMF Jakarta representative Milan Zavadjil says Indonesia's planned fuel price hike is a "very positive" development\par \par \uc2 -- But he says \uc2 Bank Indonesia\uc2  should be ready to tighten monetary policy to prevent it pushing up other prices\par \par \uc2 -- He also says the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would likely tolerate a strong gain in the rupiah if global conditions improved\par \par \uc2 (Adds comments, context throughout.)\par \par \uc2 By Natasha Brereton-Fukui\par \par \uc2 Of DOW JONES NEWSWIRES\par \par \uc2 SINGAPORE (\uc2 Dow Jones\uc2 )--Indonesia's planned increase in subsidized fuel prices is a "very positive" development, but its \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  should stand ready to tighten monetary policy to stop it pushing up other prices, Milan Zavadjil, the International Monetary Fund's senior representative in Jakarta, said in an interview Thursday.\par \par \uc2 In a speech, Zavadjil also stressed the need for flexible exchange rates and interest rates given the current uncertain environment, and said he thought Indonesia would tolerate strong appreciation in its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the rupiah, if global conditions improved.\par \par \uc2 Indonesia heavily subsidizes several fuel products to shield consumers from high oil prices. But that is costly, and its parliament is considering ways to adjust its fuel-price policy.\par \par \uc2 Zavadjil told Dow Jones Newswires the step could cause a "hiccup" in inflation, which could be "significantly" higher than the \uc2 IMF\uc2 's 2012 forecast of 5.8%, and damp private consumption, putting pressure on the fund's forecast of 6.1% growth this year.\par \par \uc2 But the country has a very strong pipeline of foreign direct investment and domestic projects, and the higher fuel prices shouldn't cause the economy to lose momentum, he said.\par \par \uc2 "From our perspective, it's a very positive development, because this subsidy spending is very large and very unproductive, and this (move) will over time create more space for spending on social issues and on infrastructure," Zavadjil said.\par \par \uc2 Still, the \uc2 IMF\uc2  official highlighted the need for \uc2 Bank Indonesia\uc2  to be as aggressive addressing inflationary pressures as it was toward signs of weakening. He noted that it had responded to fuel price hikes in 2005 and 2008, and stopped them pushing up core prices.\par \par \uc2 "I think BI needs to be ready to, again, tighten monetary conditions to prevent the spillover and the second-round effect of the fuel price hike," Zavadjil said in an interview on the sidelines of \uc2 Bank of America\uc2 -Merrill Lynch's Asean Stars Conference.\par \par \uc2 A 33% increase in fuel prices could add two to three percentage points to inflation, he said, but added that continuing favorable developments in food prices should give "room for maneuver."\par \par \uc2 Zavadjil said \uc2 Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy still seemed focused on limiting volatility, and in the past it had allowed the rupiah to adjust when confronted with strong pressures.\par \par \uc2 "I think if there's a turnaround in global sentiment and the rupiah started to appreciate, BI would be very happy with that and would tolerate a strong appreciation," he said.\par \par \uc2 -By Natasha Brereton-Fukui, Dow Jones Newswires, +65-6415-4044, natasha.brereton-fukui@dowjones.com\par \par \uc2 --I Made Sentana contributed to this report. [ 03-01-12 0659ET ]\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJ00000020120301e8310002x\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
